-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), החתימה: the parties' signatures, and the
-- approval under §29(א) of the Budget Foundations Law, given the day the
-- agreement was signed.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT budget_foundations_law
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `חתימה`

-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula ("ולראיה באו הצדדים על החתום"); no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing: the Centre of Local Government and the three large cities, and the organisation; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 A filing mark; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p4 The heading of the approval ("אישור"); no rule.

-- ¶5–¶6: under his power in §29(א) of the Budget Foundations Law, 1985,
-- the approver approves the agreement signed on 14.8.2011 between the
-- Centre of Local Government and the three large cities and the
-- organisation; dated 14 August 2011. The employers are local
-- authorities, which §29 binds; with the approval, §29 lets the agreement's
-- changes in pay stand.
@ref akn:conclusions/p5 akn:conclusions/p6
`the Oz agreement was approved under section 29 on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 14 8 2011

`section 29 lets the Oz agreement's changes stand` MEANS
    `section 29 permits the change` `a local authority` FALSE TRUE FALSE

-- akn:conclusions/p7 The signatures; no rule.
